    "title": "U.S. Economic Growth Strong, Inflation Accelerates",
    "text": "• U.S. economic growth was strong from July to September.\n• Inflation accelerated at the same time.\n• The mixed picture about the country's economy was painted less than a week before midterm elections.\n• The uncomfortably high cost of living looms larger than perhaps any other issue.\n• The country's economy is expected to be a major focus of the midterm elections.\n• The high cost of living is a major concern for many Americans.\n• The country's economic growth is expected to continue, but at a slower pace.\n• Inflation is expected to remain a concern for the country's economy.\n• The country's economy is expected to be a major issue in the upcoming midterm elections.",
